        {
          "no": 1,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "***** RETAIL BOOKING COMPLETION NOTES *****\n\nWhere was the booking made: In Store \n\nPassenger has been made aware of the importance of providing a contact number for use in Resort: y\n\nMobile contact number in Client ID: y\n\nDeparture date: 08/05/2027\n\nFFP/FVC in Client ID:\n\n****************************************************\n\nPRE EXISTING MEDICAL CONDITIONS:\nDoes the customer have any pre-existing medical conditions? N\nIf Yes, have you filled out the Special Assistance Form? \n\n****************************************************\n\nNumber of Adults: 2\nNumber of Children \u0026 Ages:\nNumber of Infants \u0026 Ages:\n\n* FLIGHTS *\n\nFlight Dates:\n\nFlight\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nDepart London Heathrow Sat 8 May 2027 00:00 Cabin VS 00\nArrival San Francisco International Apt Sat 8 May 2027 00:00\n\nFlight\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nDepart Los Angeles International Apt Sat 22 May 2027 00:00 Cabin VS 00\nArrival London Heathrow Sun 23 May 2027 00:00\n\nFlight Times:\nClass:\n\n\nHas the airlines seat booking policy been discussed?\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* HOTELS / VILLAS *\n\nROOM TYPE \u2013 *If bed requirements are different to standard please detail what you have done to confirm this and is customer aware? -\n\n\nHotel: Riu Plaza Fishermans Wharf\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Sat 8 May 2027 Check Out: Tue 11 May 2027\nDuration: 3 Nights\nMeal Plan: Bed and Breakfast\nRoom Description\nDeluxe King (DKG) 1Room\n\n\nHotel: Autocamp Yosemite\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Tue 11 May 2027 Check Out: Sat 15 May 2027\nDuration: 4 Nights\nMeal Plan: Room Only\nRoom Description\nPremium Suite (PREST) 1Room\n\nHotel: Best Western Plus Santa Barbara\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Sat 15 May 2027 Check Out: Tue 18 May 2027\nDuration: 3 Nights\nMeal Plan: Room Only\nRoom Description\nDouble Room (DBL) 1Room\n\nHotel: The Westin Desert Willow Villas, Palm Desert\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Tue 18 May 2027 Check Out: Fri 21 May 2027\nDuration: 3 Nights\nMeal Plan: Room Only\nRoom Description\n1 Bedroom Smaller Villa, 1 King, Sofa Bed (1BSVK) 1Room\n\nHotel: Hilton Los Angeles Airport\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Fri 21 May 2027 Check Out: Sat 22 May 2027\nDuration: 1 Night\nMeal Plan: Room Only\nRoom Description\nDOUBLE ROOM - DOUBLE (FAMILY PLAN) (DOURD) 1Room\n\n\n\n\nBOARD BASIS -\n\nON REQUEST, has the process been advised?\n\nSPECIAL REQUEST, is your request possible in your hotel, i.e. is bedding correct for the room type booked?\n\nHave Resort Fees, Local Fees and Taxes been advised?\n\n*****************************************************\n\n*RESORT TRANSFERS* \n\nPax weight for helicopter transfer:\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* CAR HIRE *\n\nBooked for full duration?\nIf not what are other arrangements?\n\nIs pick up time 2 after landing and drop off 3 hours before departure?\n\nDoes the car pick up and drop off at the correct locations?\n\nIs car size adequate for party?\n\nCar Insurance type?\n\nIf basic package what is the reason?\n\nIs anyone under 25 driving without Gold Plus insurance aware additional cost in resort when collecting car?\n\nHave one way drop off fees been advised?\n\n******************************************************\n\nEXCURSIONS / EXTRAS / V-ROOM / VIRGIN EXPERIENCES\nIf not booked for all pax, what is the reason?\nHelicopter experience - passenger weight:\n\n\n******************************************************\nT-BOX RE-CAP\nApplicable errata\u2019s advised: y\nNames checked phonetically : y\nItinerary recapped to pax: y\n\n******************************************************\nTOTAL COST\nFinal cost agreed including cc charge if applicable:  9430.09\nDiscount used (not applicable to OODR bookings):\n\n******************************************************\nDEPOSIT\nVHols standard deposit: 400\nPublished fare in full:\nApplicable hotel/experience charges:\nHas full deposit been taken? if no please explain why:\n\nLOW DEPOSIT\nDeposit amount taken (\u00A375pp plus \u00A325 booking fee):\nUpfront charges taken (e.g. Hotel / 20 % of Tour / Published Fare / Experience / Wedding Deposit):\nIf low deposit is lower than \u00A375pp please explain why \u0026 who authorised this:\nHas a Direct Debit been set up?\nHas the Low Deposit generic item been added?\n***************************************************\nDate remaining deposit amount to be collected:\n***************************************************\nHas this date been put in the Store diary?\n\n***************************************************\n\nItinerary recapped to pax ensuring dates and hotel / transfers match: Y o\n\nHave you advised the passenger to check the FCO website? Y\n\nHave you advised the passengers of any VISA or ESTA requirements if applicable? Y \n\nData protection advised: Y\n\n*Password* for other passengers:",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-01-24T15:17:12",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~1",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 10,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Confirmed Car on Adv Reg\nChevrolet Equinox or similar with Hertz Go Plus insurance\nbooked at \u00A3712.38 cheaper\nNew overall holiday cost \u00A38661.66\n\nAbove email sent and invoice generated ",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-12-18T12:35:03",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~10",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Hi Tara,\n\nThankyou for coming into store to get your 2027 holiday booked!\n\n In a few days, you may receive a survey regarding your experience in store and with Me.  If you could take a few moments out of your day to complete this on his behalf, it would be greatly appreciated.\n\nPlease find attached a copy of your Booking Invoice.  Please take a few moments to have a read through the advisories at the back of your invoice and double check spellings of names and dates of birth.  If anything is wrong, please let me know within 48 hours.\n\nYour Virgin Holidays Reference is 6824290\nYou can use this reference to log onto the Virgin Holidays Manage My Booking app or website.  On here you will be able to view your itinerary, invoices, countdown to departure, make payments and download/print your documents 2 weeks prior to departure.\n\nhttps://www.virginholidays.co.uk/yourbooking/\n\nYour Virgin Atlantic Reference will be available 11 months before.\nYou can use this reference to log onto the Virgin Atlantic Manage My Booking app or website.  On here you will be able to view up to date flight information, preselect seats onboard the flight and select any dietary specific meals.\n\nhttps://www.virginatlantic.com/my-trips/search\n\n\nThe option to assign seats onboard Virgin Atlantic will become available upon receipt of your flight reference number, which is above. You will then have the option to pay for a seat of your preference, or alternatively you can of course continue to select a free of charge seat once check-in opens, 24 hours before departure. Via https://www.virginatlantic.com/my-trips/search \nFor all our Flying Club members the following benefit applies - \nGold members - Can select a seat free of charge as soon as the flight reference becomes available. \nSilver members - Can select a seat free of charge from seven days before departure. \nRed members - Who have a flight booked with Virgin Atlantic Holidays, can select a seat free of charge 7 days before their departure date\nKindly note, in the event that your selected seats need to be changed, Virgin Atlantic will endeavour to seat you in a comparable alternative.\n\nIf you haven\u0027t already done so, you can sign up to the Flying Club Free of Charge and become a Red member immediately, therefore giving you free seat selection a week before departure.  All I would need is your Flying Club number emailed to me and I can input this onto your booking.\nhttps://flywith.virginatlantic.com/gb/en/flying-club.html\n\nYour Premium Baggage allowance is  - \n2 x 23kg to check in \n1 x 10kg Hand Luggage\n\nPlease keep an eye on the FCO website for the latest entry requirements into America.  These are updated by the government and can change with little notice.\n\nYou will all require an ESTA to enter the USA.  These are your US Visas and approximately $22 each.  Once approved, they will be electronically attached to your passports and valid for 2 years.  Please ensure that these are approved no less than 72 hours prior to scheduled departure.\nhttps://esta.cbp.dhs.gov/esta/\n\nThank you for booking with Me and Virgin Atlantic Holidays.  I hope you have received excellent customer service in store. \n\nIf you do need anything at all prior to your departure, please do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nMany Thanks, \nLeia Cox\n\nPersonal Holiday Advisor\n\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n\n0344 472 9601 - option 1",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-01-24T15:21:06",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~2",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Hi Tara and Priya,\u00A0\n\nI hope you are both well!\n\nGreat news, the flights and car-hire have been released for your Multi Centre trip in 2027!\n\nI just wanted to drop you an email before confirming anything, as there are a few flight times to choose from all coming up at the same price and are around \u00A355 cheaper than what we estimated,\u00A0\n\nThe flight going out to San Francisco on the 8th\u00A0of May leaves London Heathrow at 10:15 in the morning, and arrives into San Francisco at 13:50,\u00A0\n\nThen coming home, there is a flight at 16:05, 19:35 or 22:35 leaving Los Angeles. Is there a specific flight time you would prefer? These are all the same cost \uD83D\uDE42\n\nThe car hire is also released now, so as soon as I can confirm the flight times with you I will then cost up the car too\u00A0\n\nI can give you a call if you prefer or just reply to my email with your preferred return flight time\n\nLook forward to hearing from you!\n\nKindest Regards,\u00A0\nLeia Cox\nPersonal Holiday Advisor\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-08-06T15:31:12",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~3",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "\nTara White\u003Csanitized\u002B67818c57@example.com\u003E\n\u200B\nLeia Cox\u200B\nHi Leia, \n\nThank you for your email regarding flight times. Can you please send us the arrival times back to Heathrow for the 1935 and 2235 flights.\n\nRegards \n\nTara and Priya ",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-08-15T10:29:57",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~4",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Virgin Atlantic Holidays Merry Hill\n\n\uE9B6\nLeia Cox\n\u200BTara White \u003Csanitized\u002B67818c57@example.com\u003E\u200B\nHi Tara and Priya, \n\nThankyou or your email, \n\nWith the 19:35 flight time leaving Los Angeles, you would land back into Heathrow at 2pm the following day, \nWith the 22:35 flight time leaving Los Angeles you would land back at 5pm the following day \uD83D\uDE42\n\nPlease let me know which one you would prefer! \n\nMany Thanks, \nLeia Cox\n\nPersonal Holiday Advisor\n\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays\n\n0344 472 9601 - option 1",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-08-15T10:30:06",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~5",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 6,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Confirmed flights \u00A345 cheaper, new holiday cost \u00A39373.94",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-08-15T13:58:24",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~6",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 8,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Virgin Atlantic Holidays Merry Hill\n\n\uF624\nLeia Cox\n\u200BTara White \u003Csanitized\u002B67818c57@example.com\u003E\u200B\nHi Tara, \n\nI did thankyou!\n\nThankyou for letting me know, I have confirmed your flights for you and it has come down in price by around \u00A355 \uD83D\uDE42\nWe just need to wait for hotels so I will contact you as and when they are released!\n\nYour new holiday cost is \u00A39373.94\n\nAny questions please let me know\n\nSpeak Soon!\n\nLeia Cox\n\nPersonal Holiday Advisor\n\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-08-15T14:02:18",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~8",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 7,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "\nTara White\u003Csanitized\u002B67818c57@example.com\u003E\n\u200B\nLeia Cox\u200B\nHi Leia, \n\nThank you for getting back to us. Hope you had a good break from work. We would prefer the 1935 flight from LA please.\n\nRegards \n\nTara and Priya ",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-08-15T13:58:32",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~7",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 9,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Hi Tara\u00A0\n\nI hope you are well\u00A0\n\nJust dropping you a quick email regarding your booking (reference 6824290) to let you know Car Hire is finally released for 2027,\n\nOriginally you booked the Ford Edge or similar, however some of the car hire names have slightly changed, the equivalent now would be a Chevrolet Equinox.\n\nI have priced this up for you, and the Chevrolet Equinox or similar, with the Hertz Go Plus insurance is coming in \u00A3712 cheaper than what we originally estimated!\nI have confirmed this for you so you do not need to do anything \uD83D\uDE42 I have also sent an updated Booking Invoice for you to double check\u00A0\nWe are now just waiting on the hotels to be released which should be around 11 months before!\n\nIf you have any questions at all please let me know, I hope you both have a lovely Christmas,\n\nKindest Regards\nLeia Cox\nPersonal Holiday Advisor\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays",
          "displayName": "Leia Cox",
          "dateModified": "2025-12-18T12:34:15",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~9",
          "noteId": 0
        }
