          "title": "Country - US",
          "compulsory": true
        },
        {
          "no": 6,
          "code": "VIRGIN ATLANTIC SEATING",
          "description": "VIRGIN ATLANTIC SEATING",
          "note": "VIRGIN ATLANTIC SEATING \nThe option to assign seats onboard Virgin Atlantic will become available upon \nreceipt of your flight reference number, this tends to be around 331 days in \nadvance of the return travel date. \n \nYou will then have the option to pay for a seat of your preference, \nor alternatively you can of course continue to select a free of charge seat once \ncheck-in opens, 24 hours before departure. \nVia https://www.virginatlantic.com/my-trips/search \n \nFor all our Flying Club members the following benefit applies - \nGold members - Can select a seat free of charge as soon as the flight reference \nbecomes available. \nSilver members - Can select a seat free of charge from seven days before \ndeparture. \nRed members - Who have a flight booked with Virgin Atlantic Holidays, \ncan select a seat free of charge 7 days before their departure date. \n \nKindly note seats are subject to change",
          "dateModified": "2024-12-19T14:48:18",
